      <title>Hyperliquid in Talks With Kraken Parent on US Market Entry</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-31/hyperliquid-in-talks-with-kraken-parent-on-us-market-entry</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">1f538c3ef835c4865416d7a1</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 16:44:32 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Hyperliquid Labs is in advanced talks to bring its perpetual futures to US traders through Kraken’s parent company Payward, just weeks after President Donald Trump said his administration was working to bring the fast-growing platform into the US.</description>
