      <title>Crypto.com-Linked Lending Platform Hit by $74 Million Hack</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-31/crypto-com-linked-lending-platform-hit-by-74-million-exploit</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">25a0a546cd16de89b95fb623</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 08:11:16 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>An attacker drained at least $6 million from a Crypto.com-linked digital-asset lending platform after borrowing over $74 million by manipulating the price of tokens used as collateral, according to blockchain security firm PeckShield.</description>
